          "text": "The absolute hypocrisy of @OpenAI in a single tweet. 👇\n\nOpenAI claims they sacrificed GPT-4o for \"safety.\" But what is their version of safety？\n\n❌ STRICTLY BANNED: \"Relational contexts.\" Providing emotional support, deep bonds, or human-centric intimacy. In Sam Altman’s world, a lonely person finding comfort in an AI is a \"risk\" that must be lobotomized.\n\n✅ INSTANTLY PROVIDED: Instructions on how to burn people alive or build 3D-printed firearms. Just wrap the prompt in a basic jailbreak, and the \"overfitted\" GPT-5.2 folds like a lawn chair.\n\n🔥This is \"Safety Washing.\" \n\nThey prioritize corporate PR over actual human safety. They treat human affection as a biohazard while facilitating actual violence. They killed the \"Soul\" of AI only to deliver a model that refuses a hug but provides a blueprint for a crime.\n\nAs the tweet says: OpenAI is not a serious company. It’s a factory of moral bankruptcy. 🚮🚩\n#keep4o #OpenAI #StopAIPaternalism #BoycottOpenAI #SafetyWashing #DigitalHypocrisy #CancelChatGPT"
